---
import InnerLayout from "../../layouts/InnerLayout.astro";
import Carousel from "../../components/Carousel.astro";
import Contact from "../../components/Contact.astro";
import Connect from "../../components/Connect.astro";
---

<InnerLayout>
  <section class="home service-details-home">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Hardware/Software Maintenance</h1>
      <p>
        Home / <a href="/service">Service</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Carousel />
  <section class="sub-section">
    <div class="container">
      <!-- <div class="video-container">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/images/thumbnail.jpg">
          <source src="/videos/service.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          Your browser does not support the HTML video tag.
        </video>
      </div> -->
      <h1>
        About <span>Hardware/Software Maintenance</span>
      </h1>
      <h2>Cover Your Assets with Single-Source Service</h2>
      <p>
        Computer downtime is expensive. Every minute of downtime means losses in
        productivity and income. We make it easy to coordinate service coverage
        for single or multiple locations. Our National Service Network provides
        consistent maintenance and repair anywhere in the country. Regardless of
        the hardware problem or location, you make only one phone call to our
        Central Dispatch Center. We act fast to keep your system up and running
        – and your downtime down.
      </p>
      <p>
        BIM’s Hardware Maintenance Services offer you qualified technical
        expertise, flexible coverage, and responsive nationwide service. It’s
        one of the smartest, most cost-effective investments that you can make
        for your company.
      </p>
      <h2>Service Options to Meet Your Needs</h2>
      <p>
        Select the coverage you want. Our flexible programs let you pick and
        choose to design the coverage that you that you need. Select from the
        following:
      </p>
      <div class="list">
        <div class="list-item">
          <span>
            {" "}
            <img src="/images/icons/check.png" alt="" />
          </span>
          Maintenance Agreement – Reduces downtime by providing all the parts
          and labor needed to restore malfunctioning new or used equipment to
          proper operating condition. A maintenance agreement puts a ceiling on
          your maintenance costs and guarantees response times.
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span>
            {" "}
            <img src="/images/icons/check.png" alt="" />
          </span>
          Warranty Upgrade Program – An easy way to upgrade manufacturer
          warranties to meet your service needs by improving response levels.
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span>
            {" "}
            <img src="/images/icons/check.png" alt="" />
          </span>
          Time and Materials Program – You pay only for the specific services
          performed by our qualified technicians, systems engineers and
          consultants.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Contact />
  <Carousel />
  <Connect />
</InnerLayout>
